        }
      ],
      "coverPrompt": "A sunny garden scene with Pip the fox cub and Robin the robin standing together beside a small mound of soil, a tiny green sprout just emerging. Soft 3D animated style, warm golden light, rounded forms, rich colours, no text.",
      "coverAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:cover",
      "coverAudioAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:cover-audio",
      "cover": null,
      "coverAudio": null,
      "pages": [
        {
          "id": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-1",
          "number": 1,
          "title": "Page 1",
          "text": "Pip the fox found a tiny seed. Robin flew down to see. 'Let's plant it!' said Pip.",
          "imagePrompt": "Close-up of Pip's paw holding a small brown seed, Robin perched on a nearby watering can, both looking at the seed with curiosity, garden background with soft morning light, 3D animated style.",
          "imageAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-1:image",
          "audioAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-1:audio",
          "image": null,
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "id": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-2",
          "number": 2,
          "title": "Page 2",
          "text": "They dug a little hole. Pip placed the seed in, and Robin covered it with soil.",
          "imagePrompt": "Pip using a small trowel to dig, Robin using its beak to push soil over the seed, both working together, camera from a low angle showing their teamwork, bright garden colours.",
          "imageAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-2:image",
          "audioAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-2:audio",
          "image": null,
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "id": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-3",
          "number": 3,
          "title": "Page 3",
          "text": "Every day, Pip watered the spot. Robin sang a happy song. But nothing came up.",
          "imagePrompt": "Pip holding a blue watering can, pouring water onto the soil, Robin singing with beak open, both looking at the ground with hopeful expressions, soft afternoon light, gentle shadows.",
          "imageAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-3:image",
          "audioAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-3:audio",
          "image": null,
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "id": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-4",
          "number": 4,
          "title": "Page 4",
          "text": "Pip felt sad. 'Where is our flower?' Robin said, 'Be patient, little friend.'",
          "imagePrompt": "Pip sitting with drooping ears, looking at the bare soil, Robin perched on Pip's head, comforting with a gentle wing touch, warm but slightly muted lighting, emotional but calm mood.",
          "imageAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-4:image",
          "audioAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-4:audio",
          "image": null,
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "id": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-5",
          "number": 5,
          "title": "Page 5",
          "text": "The next morning, a green sprout appeared! Pip and Robin cheered and danced.",
          "imagePrompt": "A tiny green sprout breaking through the soil, Pip jumping with joy, Robin fluttering in the air, both celebrating, bright morning sun rays, vivid green and yellow tones.",
          "imageAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-5:image",
          "audioAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-5:audio",
          "image": null,
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "id": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-6",
          "number": 6,
          "title": "Page 6",
          "text": "The sunflower grew tall and bright. Pip and Robin smiled. 'We did it together!'",
          "imagePrompt": "A tall sunflower with a large yellow bloom, Pip and Robin sitting at its base, looking up with happy faces, warm golden hour lighting, full garden view, peaceful and satisfying end.",
          "imageAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-6:image",
          "audioAssetKey": "custom-7c480b44-19db-4096-a32e-df95001e7ba6:page-6:audio",
          "image": null,
          "audio": null
        }
      ]
    },
